-- Replaces the auto-generated [BASE,F-030]_emotestextsound.sql, which was a full
-- base dump that collided with patch-hd-everything on ids 600-839 (hd ships HD
-- voice sounds for stock races 1-11 there). emotestextsound.id is a surrogate key
